Project Design Phase Phase
Legalease – Project Design Phase

The Project Design Phase focuses on converting the ideas identified during brainstorming into a clear system structure, user interface, database design, and technical architecture for the Legalease project.

1. Objective of the Design Phase

The main objectives are:

Design a simple and user-friendly interface.
Define the major modules of Legalease.
Design the database structure.
Define how users interact with the system.
Plan the AI/legal information processing workflow.
Establish the technology and system architecture.
